    219  1ab8							; SMART CHORD: each held note becomes a chord built in the key, its size
    220  1ab8							; (X) 5TH, TRIAD, 7TH, 9TH or 11TH. A note in the scale gets its diatonic
    221  1ab8							; chord (stacked scale thirds); a note outside the scale a major one (+ b7,
    222  1ab8							; 9, 11). Results merge, ascending, at most 8.
