    381  3d28							; ADVANCED SOUND values (the menu's choices index these). SID vibrato depth
    382  3d28							; x 1/4096 of the frequency (61 = 1/4 semitone), rate x 1/262 Hz, delay in
    383  3d28							; 4 ms; glide 1/2^k of the way per 4 ms; tremolo depth of 15, rate x 1/655
    384  3d28							; Hz; SID detune (8 = FAT's, about 7 cents); Game Boy warble.
    385  3d28		       1e 3d 5b 7a uVibDepT   .byte.b	30, 61, 91, 122
    386  3d2c		       0c 12 18 1e*uVibRateLo .byte.b	<524, <786, <1048, <1310, <1572, <1834, <2096
