    506  54df							; ------------------------------------------------------------ actions
    507  54df							; What SPACE and the keytar's buttons do (menu: SPACE, ... BUTTON):
    508  54df							;   held     MUTE, BEND DOWN, BEND UP, VIBRATO, TREMOLO, ARP, STUTTER,
    509  54df							;	      VINYL STOP, GLIDE, SUSTAIN, OCTAVE UP, REPEAT, FILTER SWEEP,
    510  54df							;	      BEAT FILL, TAPE WOBBLE, WIDE
    511  54df							;   a press  TAP TEMPO, BEAT ON/OFF, NEXT SOUND; or NOTHING
    512  54df							; A held action can be held by several at once; it ends when the last lets go.
