    234  67fb							; ------------------------------------------------------------ One Key Play
    235  67fb							; CRSR DOWN or CRSR RIGHT (A = 1 / 2: which) pressed, ONE KEY PLAY on: the
    236  67fb							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    237  67fb							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    238  67fb							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    239  67fb							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
    240  67fb							; the next). The notes sound while either key is down (latch: until the next
    241  67fb							; press).
    242  67fb				   OkpPress
    243  67fb					      subroutine
    244  67fb		       0d 7a c8 	      ora	okpDown
    245  67fe		       8d 7a c8 	      sta	okpDown
